Modifications made by ZenWave (high level):
- Renamed the application to "ZenWave" (product name, bundle id dev.zenwave.app,
  npm package name, window titles, About panel, menus) and replaced the app icon
  and in-app logos with original ZenWave artwork.
- Moved every local and remote path, socket and cache name from "waveterm" /
  "~/.waveterm" to "zenwave" / "~/.zenwave" so ZenWave runs side by side with
  stock Wave Terminal without sharing data.
- Disabled the auto-updater and removed the release feed; telemetry, Wave cloud
  endpoints and diagnostic pings are off/no-ops by default.
- Changed the macOS packaging to produce locally built, ad-hoc signed arm64
  builds.
- User-interface and theming changes (see the git history for details).

